        'A serious industrial textile enquiry names end use, construction or performance needs, width or format, volume, and required documents. A serious apparel enquiry names style references or tech packs, sizes, fabrics, volume, labeling, and delivery window.\n\nAsk for those items. A name-and-email form rarely starts an OEM or private-label quote.',
