        'Incomplete tech packs, single-piece consumer requests, and fashion collaboration pitches outside B2B scope consume sales time. The page and the form have to signal which programs you quote.\n\nA single contact button with no volume or tech-pack fields invites retail shoppers when you sell manufacturing capacity.',
