      contentStrategy:
        'Publish the information a sourcing manager already asks for: what you manufacture, sampling steps, MOQs, and how a tech pack becomes a quote. Keep retail fashion storytelling secondary on B2B pages.\n\nSeparate industrial textile notes from apparel program notes so each buyer path stays readable.',
